Package: linuxdroid-display-manager
Version: @PROJECT_VERSION@
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: LinuxDroid Team <dev@linuxdroid.org>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libstdc++6 (>= 13)
Recommends: weston (>= 10.0)
Suggests: linuxdroid-desktop-environment | ldde
Provides: display-manager
Homepage: https://github.com/LinuxDroidapp/LDDM
Description: LinuxDroid Display Manager (LDDM)
 LDDM is the graphical session and display manager for LinuxDroid.
 It manages the graphical lifecycle, coordinates the Weston Wayland
 compositor, launches the LinuxDroid Desktop Environment (LDDE),
 and provides autonomous session fault recovery.

